  "job_B15.6.49_20251003_114333": {
    "text": "Her swutela\u00f0 Wulfric his hleofan hlaforde his cwyde & eallon his freondon.\n\u00de is \u00fe ic geann minon hlaforde twa hund mancessa goldes & twa seolforhilted sweord, & feower hors,\n& ic geann \u00e6lcum bisceope .v. mancessa goldes, & \u00feam twam arcebisceopan, heora \u00e6g\u00feran tyn\n& ic geann into \u00e6lcum munucregole .i. pund, & \u00e6lcon abbode, & \u00e6lcon abbatissan .v. mancusas goldes.\n& ic geann \u00c6lfrice arcebisceope \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Dumeltan for\u00f0 mid \u00feon o\u00f0ran for minon sawle, wi\u00f0 \u00fean\n& ic gean \u00c6lfhelme, & Wulfage \u00fe\u00e6ra landa betwux Ribbel, & M\u00e6rse, & on Wirhalum, \u00fee heo hig\n& ic geann \u00c6lfhelme Rolfestun, & Heorlfestun.\n& ic geann Wulfage \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Beorelfestune, & \u00e6t M\u00e6rchamtune.\n& ic geann \u00c6lfhelme \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Cunugesburh, wi\u00f0 \u00feon \u00fee he do \u00fe \u00fea mvnucas, habban \u00e6lce geare\n& ic geann Wulfage \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Alewaldestune, & ic geann Ufegeate \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Nor\u00f0tune, on \u00fe\n& ic geann minre earman dehter \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Elleforda, & \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6t Aclea, mid eallon \u00feam \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r nu to\n& heo hit nage mid nanon \u00feinge to forwyrcenne, ac h\u00e6bbe heo \u00f0one bryce \u00fea hwile \u00fee heo hit\n& ic wille \u00fe \u00c6lfhelm si hire mund, & \u00fe\u00e6s landes, & \u00fe \u00e6t Tamwur\u00fein hire to nanon \u00feeowdome, ne\n& ic geann Wulfgare minan cnihte \u00fe\u00e6s landes \u00e6t Baltry\u00f0eleage, ealswa his f\u00e6der hit him begeat.\n& ic becwe\u00f0e Morcare \u00fe land \u00e6t Walesho, & \u00fe \u00e6t Weogende\u00feorpe, & \u00fe \u00e6t Hwitewylle, & \u00fe \u00e6t Clune,\n& ic geann his wife Aldulfestreo, ealswa hit nu stont mid mete, & mid mannon, & ic geann \u00c6lfhelme\n& ic geann \u00c6\u00feelrice \u00fe land \u00e6t Wibbetofte, & \u00fe \u00e6t Twongan, his d\u00e6g, & ofer his d\u00e6g, ga \u00fe land for\nAnd \u00feys synd \u00fea land \u00fee ic geann into Byrtune, \u00fe is \u00e6rest Byrtun \u00fee \u00fe mynster on stent, & Str\u00e6ttun, &\nAcofre mid \u00feam \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6rto here\u00f0, \u00fe is Hilum, & Celfdun, & C\u00e6tes\u00feyrne, & \u00fe heregeatland \u00e6t Su\u00f0tune,\nAnd ic geann \u00feam hirede in Tamwur\u00f0in, \u00fe land \u00e6t Langandune, ealswa hi hit \u00e6r me to leton, & habban\n& se bisceop fo to his lande \u00e6t Bubbandune, & fon \u00f0a munucas into Byrtune, to \u00feam \u00fee on \u00feam land is,\n& ic wylle \u00fe se cyning beo hlaford, \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres \u00f0e ic getimbrede, & \u00fe\u00e6ra landara \u00fee ic \u00f0yderinn\n& ic geann minre goddehter Morkares, & Aldgy\u00f0e, \u00fe land \u00e6t Str\u00e6ttune, & \u00f0one bule \u00fee w\u00e6s hire\n& into \u00feam mynstre \u00e6t Byrtune, an hund wildra horsa, & sextena tame hencgestas, & \u00fe\u00e6rto eall \u00fe ic\n& god \u00e6lmihtig hine awende of eallum godes dreame, & of ealra cristenra gemanan, se \u00f0e \u00feis awende,\n& ic hopyge to him swa godan, & swa mildheortan, \u00fe he hit nylle sylf don, ne eac nanum o\u00ferum menn",
